WEBVTT

00:00:09.707 --> 00:00:11.587
KEN ON MONITOR: Little late
for a stroll, eh, Potato Head?

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.267
That's Mr. Potato Head to you,
smoothie.

00:00:14.587 --> 00:00:16.347
KEN: Well, well, well.
You're turning out to be

00:00:16.427 --> 00:00:18.067
quite the troublemaker, aren't you?

00:00:18.187 --> 00:00:20.507
KEN: What did you think you were
gonna do? Waltz right out of here?

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.347
MR. POTATO HEAD: Yeah,
and I would've got away with it, too,

00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:23.667
if it weren't for you meddling toys!

00:00:23.747 --> 00:00:25.227
You ascot-wearing pink-noser!

00:00:25.547 --> 00:00:27.667
You're not a toy! You're an accessory!

00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:29.187
You're a purse with legs.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:31.227
Ow! Take him back to the box.

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:35.747
No! No, not the box! I'm sorry.
I didn't mean it! I like ascots.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.267
Really. No, no, no!

00:00:38.907 --> 00:00:39.907
Okay, check.

00:00:40.147 --> 00:00:44.107
Good work, Lightyear. All right,
resume your, uh, space-guy-thingy.

00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:46.547
Yes, sir, well-groomed man!

00:00:46.627 --> 00:00:48.747
BARBIE: Ken! Ken?

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:51.787
(CRYING)

00:00:51.907 --> 00:00:53.227
KEN: What do you want?

00:00:53.307 --> 00:00:56.707
I can't take it here, Ken. I wanna go
to the Butterfly Room. With you!

00:00:56.787 --> 00:00:58.627
Yeah, well, you should've
thought of that yesterday.

00:00:58.867 --> 00:01:00.147
I was wrong.

00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:03.307
I wanna be with you, Ken, I do.
In your Dream House.

00:01:03.427 --> 00:01:06.787
(SOBBING) Please take me away
from this! Take me away!

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.307
Darn it, Barbie!

00:01:09.787 --> 00:01:12.267
Okay, but things
are complicated around here.

00:01:12.387 --> 00:01:15.467
-You gotta do what I say.
-I will, Ken! I promise!

00:01:17.507 --> 00:01:20.307
Wait. I'll do anything!
I'll change your diapers!

00:01:53.307 --> 00:01:55.107
-(SCREECHING)
-(YELLING)

00:01:57.707 --> 00:01:58.827
(HISSING)

00:02:07.347 --> 00:02:08.867
Go get the tape!

00:02:15.787 --> 00:02:18.307
KEN: And this is where
the magic happens.

00:02:18.387 --> 00:02:19.547
(GASPS)

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:20.947
Look at all your clothes!

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:22.867
I can't believe
you never brought me up here!

00:02:23.307 --> 00:02:25.467
-Tennis whites? Mission to Mars!
-KEN: I know, I know, I know.

00:02:25.547 --> 00:02:27.227
Check this out! Kung fu fighting.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.907
Campus hero
with matching sports pennant, huh?

00:02:30.027 --> 00:02:33.147
(GASPS) Flower power! Oh, Ken!

00:02:33.227 --> 00:02:34.467
(SIGHING)

00:02:34.547 --> 00:02:38.027
No one appreciates clothes
here, Barbie. No one.

00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:43.067
Ken, would you
model a few outfits for me?

00:02:43.587 --> 00:02:45.027
Just a few?

00:02:45.227 --> 00:02:47.587
(DISCO MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:49.987
(GIGGLING)

00:02:52.227 --> 00:02:53.347
Rawr!

00:03:12.027 --> 00:03:13.427
(MUFFLED SCREECHING)

00:03:15.747 --> 00:03:16.787
Go get the key.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.427
Where is it, where is it?

00:03:19.587 --> 00:03:21.427
Where's the key?
Where's the key? Bingo!

00:03:28.787 --> 00:03:30.547
Yodel-ay-hee-hoo!

00:03:32.107 --> 00:03:34.027
HAMM: Hey!
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:34.107 --> 00:03:37.027
I told you,
keep your hands off of my stuff!

00:03:37.427 --> 00:03:38.867
Make a move, porky!

00:03:39.947 --> 00:03:42.467
Hey, hey, hey! No fighting! Break it up!

00:03:44.707 --> 00:03:46.867
-Hey! Hey!
-HAMM: Take that, walnut-brain.

00:03:46.947 --> 00:03:48.147
No wonder you're extinct.

00:03:48.947 --> 00:03:51.147
Hey, you can't hit each other.
That's my job!

00:03:51.227 --> 00:03:52.307
JESSIE: Yoo-hoo!

00:03:55.307 --> 00:03:56.707
Help! Prison riot!

00:03:59.947 --> 00:04:01.467
Get the tortilla.

00:04:41.947 --> 00:04:43.427
KEN: Ready?
BARBIE: Ready.

00:04:43.587 --> 00:04:45.427
(EXCLAIMING)

00:04:51.027 --> 00:04:52.507
Uh, Barbie?

00:04:54.707 --> 00:04:57.387
No more games, Ken!
What did Lotso do to Buzz?

00:04:57.507 --> 00:04:58.707
And how do we switch him back?

00:04:58.787 --> 00:05:00.707
You can't make me talk. You can't!

00:05:02.467 --> 00:05:04.067
But I'd like to see you try.

